WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Every letter appears. But can you report them all?

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Find the first marked target.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Now a second one arrives, just afterward.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
In some laboratory tasks, that second target is missed.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Change the delay or distractors, and the result may change.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
The display is evidence. The explanation is a question.
